which sets some coefficients to exactly 0 and so selects covariates. \code{l1_ratio = 0} is ridge
regression, which shrinks all of the coefficients toward 0 without removing any. Values in
between mix the two. Tied event times are handled with Breslow's method, and \code{penalizer = 0}
gives the unpenalized Cox fit with Breslow ties.
